@baseUrl = http://localhost:47821
@deviceToken = REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_LOCAL_DEVICE_KEY
@epoch = REPLACE_WITH_EPOCH_FROM_BASELINE

### Establish a baseline without replaying old completions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}

### Read new completions from a known baseline
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications?epoch={{epoch}}&after=0
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}

### Subscribe (SSE); keep the returned cursor for reconnects
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/events?epoch={{epoch}}&after=0
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
Accept: text/event-stream

### Invalid cursor returns a problem response
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications?epoch={{epoch}}&after=-1
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
